{"paragraphs":[{"text":"%md\n# About This Lab\n**Objective:** Become familiar with simple RDD operations\n**File locations:** /devsh_loudacre/\n**Successful outcome:**\n**Before you begin:**\n**Related lessons:** Working with RDDs\n\nCopyright © 2010–2021 Cloudera. All rights reserved.\nNot to be reproduced or shared without prior written consent from Cloudera.\n\n---","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-16T13:03:38-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","editorHide":true,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1638224982567_704677165","id":"20171105-200834_1116095891","dateCreated":"2021-11-29T14:29:42-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-16T13:03:38-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-16T13:03:38-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"focus":true,"$$hashKey":"object:1591"},{"text":"%md\n# Setup\n---\n\nThe following cells allow this notebook to run without errors from top to bottom any number of times","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-16T13:03:38-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1638224982568_-1715885695","id":"20181114-164229_902436001","dateCreated":"2021-11-29T14:29:42-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-16T13:03:38-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-16T13:03:38-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1592"},{"text":"%sh\n\nhdfs dfs -rm -r -f /devsh_loudacre/frostroad.txt\nhdfs dfs -rm -r -f /devsh_loudacre/makes*.txt","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-16T13:03:38-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"sh","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/sh","fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1638224982569_1030743516","id":"20200113-225014_1330911389","dateCreated":"2021-11-29T14:29:42-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-16T13:03:38-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-16T13:03:44-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1593"},{"text":"%md\n# Lab\n---","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-16T13:03:44-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1638224982569_1054547048","id":"20181114-164844_1661453681","dateCreated":"2021-11-29T14:29:42-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-16T13:03:44-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-16T13:03:44-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1594"},{"text":"%md\n### Review the API Documentation for RDD Operations\n\nReview the API docs for the RDD class (which is in the Python module pyspark, and the Scala package org.apache.spark.rdd). \nTake note of the various available operations.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-16T13:03:44-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1638224982569_119602448","id":"20200113-224229_628565915","dateCreated":"2021-11-29T14:29:42-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-16T13:03:44-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-16T13:03:44-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1595"},{"text":"%md\n### Read and Display Data from a Text File\n\nReview the simple text file you will be using.\nThe file is located at /home/training/training_materials/devsh/data/frostroad.txt.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-16T13:03:44-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1638224982569_872925443","id":"20200113-224321_2135751926","dateCreated":"2021-11-29T14:29:42-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-16T13:03:44-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-16T13:03:44-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1596"},{"title":"1 - Read /home/training/training_materials/dev/data/frostroad.txt","text":"%sh\ncat /home/training/training_materials/dev/data/frostroad.txt","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-16T13:03:44-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"sh","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/sh","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1638224982570_-283518721","id":"20200113-224501_1013111284","dateCreated":"2021-11-29T14:29:42-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-16T13:03:44-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-16T13:03:44-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1597"},{"title":"2 - Upload the text file to HDFS directory /devsh_loudacre","text":"%sh\nhdfs dfs -put /home/training/training_materials/dev/data/frostroad.txt /devsh_loudacre","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-16T13:03:44-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"sh","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/sh","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1638224982570_409401485","id":"20200113-224925_2003023834","dateCreated":"2021-11-29T14:29:42-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-16T13:03:45-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-16T13:03:47-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1598"},{"title":"3 - Define an RDD based on the frostroad.txt text file","text":"%pyspark\n\n# Load the txt file as an RDD of strings\nRDD_pyspark = sc.textFile(\"/devsh_loudacre/frostroad.txt\")","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-16T13:03:48-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1638224982570_1126501337","id":"20200113-225910_142286046","dateCreated":"2021-11-29T14:29:42-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-16T13:03:48-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-16T13:04:34-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1599"},{"text":"%md\nSpark has not yet read the file. \nIt will not do so until you perform an action on the RDD.\nTry counting the number of elements in the RDD using the count action:","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-16T13:04:35-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1638224982570_133648840","id":"20200113-230441_1168973087","dateCreated":"2021-11-29T14:29:42-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-16T13:04:35-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-16T13:04:35-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1600"},{"title":"4 - Count the lines in your RDD","text":"%pyspark\n\n# Count the total number of records\ntotal_records = RDD_pyspark.count()\nprint(f\"Total number of records: {total_records}\")","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-16T13:04:35-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1638224982571_-1615734776","id":"20200113-230437_57310419","dateCreated":"2021-11-29T14:29:42-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-16T13:04:35-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-16T13:04:40-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1601"},{"text":"%md\nThe count operation causes the RDD to be materialized (created and populated).\nThe number of lines (23) should be displayed, for example:\n```pyspark\nOut[2]: 23(Python) \n```\nor\n```spark\nres1: Long = 23(Scala)\n```\nCall the collect operation to return all data in the RDD to the Spark driver. \nTake note of the type of the return value; in Python will be a list of strings, and in Scala it will be an array of strings.\n\n**Note:** collect returns the entire set of data. This is convenient for very small RDDs like this one, but be careful using collect for more typical large sets of data.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-16T13:04:40-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1638224982571_-858956604","id":"20200113-230739_691307132","dateCreated":"2021-11-29T14:29:42-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-16T13:04:40-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-16T13:04:40-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1602"},{"title":"5 - Collect your RDD","text":"%pyspark\n\n# Collect data\nlist_of_strings = RDD_pyspark.collect()","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-16T13:04:40-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1638224982571_-634773184","id":"20200113-230735_278776244","dateCreated":"2021-11-29T14:29:42-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-16T13:04:40-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-16T13:04:41-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1603"},{"title":"6 - Display the contents of the collected data by looping through the collection","text":"%pyspark\n\n# Looping the list of strings\ni = 0\n\nfor raw in list_of_strings:\n    print(f\"Raw[{i}]: \", raw)\n    i += 1","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-16T13:04:42-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1638224982572_728274787","id":"20200113-231332_2020637729","dateCreated":"2021-11-29T14:29:42-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-16T13:04:42-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-16T13:04:42-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1604"},{"text":"%md\n### Transform Data in an RDD\n\nIn this exercise, you will load two text files containing the names of various cell phone makes, and append one to the other. \nReview the two text files you will be using by viewing (without editing) the file in a separate window. \nThe files are makes1.txt and makes2.txt in the /home/training/training_materials/devsh/data directory.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-16T13:04:42-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1638224982572_-1549409511","id":"20200113-231500_1328075001","dateCreated":"2021-11-29T14:29:42-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-16T13:04:42-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-16T13:04:42-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1605"},{"title":"7 - Upload the two text file to HDFS directory /devsh_loudacre","text":"%sh\n\n# We can upload these 2 files with the following 2 commands (commented):\n# hdfs dfs -put /home/training/training_materials/dev/data/makes1.txt /devsh_loudacre\n# hdfs dfs -put /home/training/training_materials/dev/data/makes2.txt /devsh_loudacre\n\n# Or with 1 command by forcing the overwrite if these files already exist:\nhdfs dfs -put -f /home/training/training_materials/dev/data/makes*.txt /devsh_loudacre","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-16T13:04:42-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"sh","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/sh","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1638224982572_1249854891","id":"20200113-231458_1609746509","dateCreated":"2021-11-29T14:29:42-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-16T13:04:42-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-16T13:04:45-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1606"},{"title":"8 - Create an RDD called makes1RDD based on the /devsh_loudacre/makes1.txt file","text":"%pyspark\n\n# Load the txt file as an RDD of strings with the name \"makes1RDD\"\nmakes1RDD = sc.textFile(\"/devsh_loudacre/makes1.txt\")","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-16T13:04:45-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1638224982572_-1481719624","id":"20200113-232112_1295518722","dateCreated":"2021-11-29T14:29:42-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-16T13:04:45-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-16T13:04:46-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1607"},{"title":"9 - Display the contents of the makes1RDD data using collect and then looping through returned collection","text":"%pyspark\n\n# Looping the list of strings of \"makes1RDD\"\ni = 0\n\nfor raw in makes1RDD.collect():\n    print(f\"Raw[{i}]: \", raw)\n    i += 1","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-16T13:04:46-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1638224982573_-458002098","id":"20200113-232111_276596298","dateCreated":"2021-11-29T14:29:42-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-16T13:04:46-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-16T13:04:47-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1608"},{"title":"10 - Repeat the previous steps to create and display an RDD called makes2RDD based on the second file, /devsh_loudacre/makes2.txt","text":"%pyspark\n\n# Load the txt file as an RDD of strings with the name \"makes2RDD\"\nmakes2RDD = sc.textFile(\"/devsh_loudacre/makes2.txt\")\n\n# Looping the list of strings of \"makes2RDD\"\ni = 0\n\nfor raw in makes2RDD.collect():\n    print(f\"Raw[{i}]: \", raw)\n    i += 1","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-16T13:04:47-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1638224982573_-1193039556","id":"20200113-232706_792978821","dateCreated":"2021-11-29T14:29:42-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-16T13:04:48-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-16T13:04:49-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1609"},{"title":"11 - Create a new RDD by appending the second RDD to the first using the union transformation","text":"%pyspark\n\n# Merges two RDDs (duplicates are kept)\nallMakesRDD = makes1RDD.union(makes2RDD)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-16T13:04:49-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1638224982573_-177470000","id":"20200113-232958_1153053244","dateCreated":"2021-11-29T14:29:42-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-16T13:04:49-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-16T13:04:50-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1610"},{"title":"12 - Collect and display the contents of the new allMakesRDD RDD","text":"%pyspark\n\n# Looping the list of strings of \"allMakesRDD\"\ni = 0\n\nfor raw in allMakesRDD.collect():\n    print(f\"Raw[{i}]: \", raw)\n    i += 1","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-16T13:04:50-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1638224982573_1941085330","id":"20200113-233207_1689738900","dateCreated":"2021-11-29T14:29:42-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-16T13:04:50-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-16T13:04:51-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1611"},{"text":"%md\nUse the distinct transformation to remove duplicates from allMakesRDD.\nCollect and display the contents to confirm that duplicate elements were removed.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-16T13:04:51-0800","config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/markdown","fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1638224982573_-1570136847","id":"20200113-233456_1826475012","dateCreated":"2021-11-29T14:29:42-0800","dateStarted":"2026-11-16T13:04:52-0800","dateFinished":"2026-11-16T13:04:52-0800","status":"FINISHED","errorMessage":"","progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"$$hashKey":"object:1612"},{"title":"13 - Use the distinct transformation to remove duplicates from allMakesRDD","text":"%pyspark\n\n# Removing the duplicate ones\nfinalMakesRDD = allMakesRDD.distinct()\n\n# Looping the list of strings of \"finalMakesRDD\"\ni = 0\n\nfor raw in finalMakesRDD.collect():\n    print(f\"Raw[{i}]: \", raw)\n    i += 1","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2026-11-16T13:04:52-0800","config":{"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true},"colWidth":12,"editorMode":"ace/mode/python","fontSize":9,"title":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"jobName":"paragraph_1638224982574_-173546166","id":"20200113-233451_1173735